# Preconditions and early failures of start. can_begin / initialize_encoders false: start returns false, nothing else happens.
# Failures inside the start thread are reported through the stop signal (start itself has already returned true).
create
world can_begin off
start
world can_begin on
world init_ok off
start
world init_ok on
state
world service off
start
events
world service on
world vformat none
start
events
world vformat nv12
world ainfo off
start
events
world ainfo on
world vinfo off
start
events
world vinfo on
world vcodec nonexistent
start
events
world vcodec h264
state
